# Normalise line endings. Added 2026-08-19 after internal/web/web_test.go was committed with
# CRLF terminators (a PowerShell write on Windows), which made `gofmt -l` flag it permanently
# and produced a WHOLE-FILE diff on every touch — churn that gets misattributed to whichever
# agent edited the file next. Without this, the repo's formatting signal is unreliable.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.go   text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.png  binary
